# PHASE 6 – PROJECT TESTING PHASE

## Project Name

**Employee Data Import and Management System Using ServiceNow**

## 1. Introduction

The Project Testing Phase verifies whether the Employee Data Import and Management System works correctly.

The imported employee data, field mappings, transformation process, and final records are tested to ensure that the expected results are obtained.

## 2. Testing Objectives

The main objectives of testing are:

* Verify the employee spreadsheet data.
* Verify the Import Set.
* Verify the Transform Map.
* Verify field mapping.
* Verify data transformation.
* Verify final employee records.
* Identify and correct errors.

## 3. Test Cases

| Test Case               | Expected Result                    | Actual Result     | Status |
| ----------------------- | ---------------------------------- | ----------------- | ------ |
| Excel file loading      | File loads successfully            | File loaded       | Pass   |
| Import Set creation     | Import Set created                 | Created           | Pass   |
| Employee records import | Records displayed                  | Records displayed | Pass   |
| Transform Map           | Source and target connected        | Connected         | Pass   |
| Field Mapping           | Fields mapped correctly            | Mapped correctly  | Pass   |
| Data Transformation     | Records transformed successfully   | Successful        | Pass   |
| Final Records           | Records displayed in Employee Test | Displayed         | Pass   |

